---
// HowItWorks — 4 pasos DS spec con íconos del brand-icons set
---

<section id="como-funciona" class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-10">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--sky-600)]">
        Cómo funciona
      </p>
      <h2 class="t-display-3 text-[var(--slate-800)]">
        De la respuesta del alumno al diagnóstico, en segundos
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 t-body text-[var(--fg-2)]">
        Un flujo pensado para que el profesor intervenga en el momento correcto, no el lunes después de la prueba del viernes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Steps — 4 pasos DS spec -->
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <!-- Paso 1 -->
      <div class="card flex flex-col gap-4" style="border-color: var(--sky-100); background: var(--sky-50);">
        <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background: var(--sky-600);">
          <!-- camera icon -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M14.5 4h-5L7 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3l-2.5-3z"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="13" r="3"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-white" style="background: var(--sky-600);">1</div>
        <p class="t-body-sm text-[var(--sky-900)]">El alumno escanea o resuelve el ejercicio digitalmente</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Paso 2 -->
      <div class="card flex flex-col gap-4" style="border-color: var(--slate-100); background: var(--bg);">
        <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background: var(--slate-700);">
          <!-- settings icon -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
            <path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 4.6a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-white" style="background: var(--slate-700);">2</div>
        <p class="t-body-sm text-[var(--fg-2)]">El motor de IA clasifica el error y actualiza el modelo de dominio</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Paso 3 -->
      <div class="card flex flex-col gap-4" style="border-color: var(--error-border); background: var(--error-bg);">
        <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background: var(--mastery-medium);">
          <!-- alert-triangle icon -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M10.29 3.86 1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/>
            <path d="M12 9v4"/>
            <path d="M12 17h.01"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-white" style="background: var(--mastery-medium);">3</div>
        <p class="t-body-sm text-[var(--error-fg)]">El profesor recibe una alerta si hay un patrón crítico</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Paso 4 -->
      <div class="card flex flex-col gap-4" style="border-color: var(--mint-100); background: var(--mint-50);">
        <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl" style="background: var(--mint-600);">
          <!-- check-circle icon -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-white" style="background: var(--mint-600);">4</div>
        <p class="t-body-sm text-[var(--mint-900)]">El apoderado ve el progreso resumido en la app</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
